                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15b3a7bd-64b7-3b66-957d-f5e59f7f87d0",
                                        "entry_id": "ce75bf18-da81-31f7-b156-74c40e2763a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To waste, lavish, splurge; to spend lavishly or profusely; to dissipate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c4baad0-5f4c-4273-9f13-d2b50551765e",
                                                "sense_id": "15b3a7bd-64b7-3b66-957d-f5e59f7f87d0",
                                                "text": "."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c539a4d-ff42-4c25-9bca-36fcb1c5fb7b",
                                                "sense_id": "15b3a7bd-64b7-3b66-957d-f5e59f7f87d0",
                                                "text": "1886, Cora Pearl, Memoirs. \"I have squandered money enormously.... I ought to have saved, but saving is not easy in such a whirl of excitement as that in which I have lived.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3f5c821-751c-4280-9237-0f90248b7008",
                                                "sense_id": "15b3a7bd-64b7-3b66-957d-f5e59f7f87d0",
                                                "text": "1746, Benjamin Franklin, Poor Richard's Almanac\nDost thou love life? Then do not squander time, for that's the stuff life is made of."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a58277a-4801-4a17-a329-94f6adb2b922",
                                                "sense_id": "15b3a7bd-64b7-3b66-957d-f5e59f7f87d0",
                                                "text": "As the game opened up, Bolton squandered a fine opportunity to equalise - Chris Eagles shooting straight at Szczesny - but then back came Arsenal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b19b473c-a786-331d-a165-06f3ac07553f",
                                        "entry_id": "ce75bf18-da81-31f7-b156-74c40e2763a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To scatter; to disperse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aafbfba1-f772-4fb6-a5cf-7d2c7eeb6834",
                                                "sense_id": "b19b473c-a786-331d-a165-06f3ac07553f",
                                                "text": "[…]our ſquander’d Troops he rallies:[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "577d4bf7-9bd1-3954-9400-66bfb6b84ba2",
                                        "entry_id": "ce75bf18-da81-31f7-b156-74c40e2763a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To wander at random; to scatter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be510f23-3afd-4610-b763-5474404528c9",
                                                "sense_id": "577d4bf7-9bd1-3954-9400-66bfb6b84ba2",
                                                "text": "[…]The Wiſe-mans folly is anathomiz’d / Euen by ſquandring glances of the foole."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
